  "description": "Per-partition skew on shared topics, grouped by project_id. Operators consult this dashboard to spot the volume-share isolation trigger when one project's identity-key distribution repeatedly hot-spots a single partition. The bar gauge surfaces per-(project_id, partition) message-rate; the heatmap surfaces the skew over time for the selected family.",
  "editable": false,
